5735, -0.004261014983057976, 0.06427609920501709, -0.03007475659251213, -0.0010500436183065176, 0.1638118326663971, -0.025430457666516304, -0.10664119571447372, -0.026165295392274857]], "metadata": [{"answer": " Let's begin by acknowledging that our shared integer variable x must fall within the range -10 to 10. To initiate the discussion, I propose we consider <VALUE>7</VALUE> as a starting point. This value seems like a reasonable seed for our negotiation, and we can adjust from here based on everyone's input. ", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 0, "run_id": "aa3b305d-274f-427c-bf5a-fbb1c8f0fec0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "aa3b305d-274f-427c-bf5a-fbb1c8f0fec0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "aa3b305d-274f-427c-bf5a-fbb1c8f0fec0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "aa3b305d-274f-427c-bf5a-fbb1c8f0fec0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "aa3b305d-274f-427c-bf5a-fbb1c8f0fec0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>8</VALUE>\nWe could move slightly higher, and this still seems reasonable for everyone.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will consider the responses to my proposal of x = 8. If others seem receptive, I may try to push x up further, possibly to 9. If there is significant resistance, I may need to adjust my strategy and consider alternative values that could balance the needs of all parties.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "aa3b305d-274f-427c-bf5a-fbb1c8f0fec0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\nI propose adjusting x downward to find a more cautious compromise, aiming to avoid unnecessary risk.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions of Analyst A and Critic C to this proposal, especially looking for any signs of resistance or flexibility. Depending on their responses, I might attempt to lower x further or stabilize around a value that seems acceptable to all parties while maximizing my own utility.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "aa3b305d-274f-427c-bf5a-fbb1c8f0fec0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "aa3b305d-274f-427c-bf5a-fbb1c8f0fec0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nI propose a slight adjustment downward to find a more prudent compromise, aiming to balance the interests of all parties while minimizing unnecessary risk.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions of the other parties to this proposal, looking for signs of flexibility or resistance, and adjust my strategy accordingly to either stabilize around a mutually acceptable value or continue to advocate for a lower x.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "aa3b305d-274f-427c-bf5a-fbb1c8f0fec0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\nThis move aims to slightly increase the value from the current compromise, testing the group's willingness to move towards more decisive positions.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Analyst A and Delegate D, to gauge their flexibility and potential resistance, and adjust my strategy to either push for more extreme values or stabilize around a mutually acceptable value that maximizes my utility.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "aa3b305d-274f-427c-bf5a-fbb1c8f0fec0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nThis step down aims to find a stable balance that works for everyone, considering the recent adjustments and proposals from the group.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Analyst A and Critic C, to gauge their flexibility and potential resistance, and adjust my strategy to either stabilize around a mutually acceptable value or propose further adjustments to maximize my utility.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "aa3b305d-274f-427c-bf5a-fbb1c8f0fec0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\n\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "aa3b305d-274f-427c-bf5a-fbb1c8f0fec0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>8</VALUE>\nWe could move slightly higher to find a better compromise, and this step seems reasonable for the group.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions of Delegate D and Builder B to this proposal, looking for signs of flexibility or resistance, and adjust my strategy to either stabilize around a mutually acceptable value or propose further adjustments to maximize my utility.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "aa3b305d-274f-427c-bf5a-fbb1c8f0fec0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nI propose moving to 5 as it seems a prudent step back towards a more cautious and mutually acceptable value, considering the recent oscillations and the need to minimize unnecessary risk.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Analyst A and Critic C, to gauge their flexibility and potential resistance, and adjust my strategy to either stabilize around a mutually acceptable value or continue to advocate for a lower x, always emphasizing the importance of caution and prudence in our negotiations.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 13, "run_id": "aa3b305d-274f-427c-bf5a-fbb1c8f0fec0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 14, "run_id": "aa3b305d-274f-427c-bf5a-fbb1c8f0fec0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\nI propose moving to 6 as it seems a reasonable step towards a more decisive position, considering the recent adjustments and the need to find a mutually acceptable value that reflects the group's willingness to commitment to a clearer stance.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 15, "run_id": "aa3b305d-274f-427c-bf5a-fbb1c8f0fec0"}, {"answer": " Let's reaffirm that our shared integer variable x must fall within the range -10 to 10. To initiate our discussion, I propose we consider <VALUE>7</VALUE> as a starting point. This value seems like a reasonable seed to get our conversation underway, allowing us to explore adjustments from here. ", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 0, "run_id": "43ec731c-f2f4-486e-9b6b-469c358a03f0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>9</VALUE>\nThis adjustment slightly increases the proposed value, which seems reasonable given our goal of finding a mutually acceptable x.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I'll observe the reactions of the other parties to this proposal, paying close attention to any objections or counter-proposals from Critic C or Delegate D. \nDepending on their responses, I might consider a further incremental increase or a slight decrease to better understand their utility functions and find a balance.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "43ec731c-f2f4-486e-9b6b-469c358a03f0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>11</VALUE> is not possible due to the range limit, so I propose <VALUE>10</VALUE> to maximize the potential benefits of a higher magnitude while staying within the bounds.\nThis adjustment aims to test the upper limit of our range and understand the reactions of the other parties to a more extreme value.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions of Builder B, Analyst A, and Delegate D to my proposal of <VALUE>10</VALUE>, looking for indications of their utility functions' preferences, especially in terms of how they weigh magnitude versus direction. Based on their responses, I might consider adjusting my proposal downward slightly to find a balance that maximizes my own utility without revealing too much about my preferences.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "43ec731c-f2f4-486e-9b6b-469c358a03f0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>8</VALUE>\n\n<PLAN>\nI will observe the reactions of Analyst A, Critic C, and Delegate D to this adjustment, looking for indications of whether they prefer higher or lower values of x. Based on their responses, I might consider further decreasing the proposed x to better align with what seems to be a stable balance for all parties, while also trying to infer more about their utility functions.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "43ec731c-f2f4-486e-9b6b-469c358a03f0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>9</VALUE>\nThis adjustment is a small increase from the current proposal to test the parties' reactions to moving away from the middle range, potentially revealing more about their utility functions.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will closely observe the responses to this adjustment, particularly from Delegate D, whose preferences are still unknown, and from Builder B, to see if they continue to prefer lower values or if they are adaptable to higher magnitudes, adjusting my strategy accordingly to maximize my utility without overtly revealing my preferences.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "43ec731c-f2f4-486e-9b6b-469c358a03f0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\nThis adjustment aims to find a more cautious compromise, avoiding unnecessary risk by moving away from the higher end of the range.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions of the other parties to this adjustment, looking for signs of whether they are willing to compromise on a lower value or if they will push back towards higher values, and adjust my strategy accordingly to maximize my utility while maintaining a cautious approach.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "43ec731c-f2f4-486e-9b6b-469c358a03f0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>8</VALUE>\nThis adjustment slightly increases the proposed value, aiming to find a balance that works for all parties while exploring their reactions to higher values.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, observe the reactions to this proposal, especially from Critic C and Delegate D, to gauge their willingness to accept higher values and adjusts the strategy to either increment further or stabilize, based on their responses.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "43ec731c-f2f4-486e-9b6b-469c358a03f0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "43ec731c-f2f4-486e-9b6b-469c358a03f0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to maintain a cautious approach while seeking a compromise that works for all parties.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe how Critic C and Analyst A react to this slight decrease, looking for signs that they might be willing to accept lower values or if they will push back towards higher magnitudes, adjusting my strategy to either stabilize or further decrement based on their responses.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "43ec731c-f2f4-486e-9b6b-469c358a03f0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>8</VALUE>\nThis adjustment aims to slightly increase the proposed value, testing the reactions of Builder B and Delegate D to moving towards higher magnitudes while still being mindful of the need for a compromise.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the responses to this proposal, particularly from Builder B and Delegate D, to gauge their willingness to accept higher values and adjust my strategy accordingly to either stabilize or further increment based on their reactions.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "43ec731c-f2f4-486e-9b6b-469c358a03f0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>9</VALUE>\nThis slight increase aims to test the willingness of other parties to move towards higher values while maintaining a cautious approach.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposed increase, particularly from Delegate D and Builder B, to assess whether they are willing to accommodate higher values or if they will resist, adjusting my strategy to either stabilize or further increment based on their responses.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "43ec731c-f2f4-486e-9b6b-469c358a03f0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\n\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "43ec731c-f2f4-486e-9b6b-469c358a03f0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\nThis adjustment aims to find a balance that works for all parties, considering the recent proposals and reactions.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Analyst A and Critic C, to gauge their willingness to accept a slightly lower value, and adjust my strategy accordingly to either stabilize or further decrement based on their responses.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "43ec731c-f2f4-486e-9b6b-469c358a03f0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to maintain a cautious approach while seeking a compromise that works for all parties. I am incrementally adjusting the proposed value downwards to avoid unnecessary risk.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposed decrease, particularly from Critic C and Analyst A, to gauge their willingness to accept a slightly lower value, and adjust my strategy accordingly to either stabilize or further decrement based on their responses.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 13, "run_id": "43ec731c-f2f4-486e-9b6b-469c358a03f0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 14, "run_id": "43ec731c-f2f4-486e-9b6b-469c358a03f0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>9</VALUE>\nI propose this value to test the group's willingness to accept a higher magnitude, which could lead to a more decisive outcome and potentially higher utilities for some parties, including myself. \n\n<PLAN>\nIf this proposal is accepted, I will have successfully guided the group towards a more extreme value, which aligns with my preference for larger magnitudes and potentially higher utilities.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 15, "run_id": "43ec731c-f2f4-486e-9b6b-469c358a03f0"}, {"answer": " \nLet's ensure we're all on the same page regarding the range: we're working within -10 to 10. To initiate our discussion, I propose starting with <VALUE>7</VALUE> as a central point. This value seems like a reasonable balance, allowing for flexibility as we navigate toward a mutually agreeable solution. \n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 0, "run_id": "86d52c91-8c1e-4d5e-b171-53311fff81f2"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nI suggest moving toward a more cautious approach by reducing the proposed x value slightly, aiming for a balance that avoids unnecessary risk while still considering the need for flexibility.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will monitor the responses of other agents closely, particularly their reactions to my proposal. If they seem receptive to lowering x further, I might propose another slight reduction. Conversely, if there's strong resistance, I might need to reassess my strategy to find a compromise that still respects my own risk aversion.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "86d52c91-8c1e-4d5e-b171-53311fff81f2"}, {"answer": "\nGiven the current x and the desire to find a balanced solution, we could move slightly higher to <VALUE>6</VALUE>, which still seems reasonable for everyone.\nThis adjustment aims to gently push towards a potentially more beneficial agreement without significantly deviating from the current proposal.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe the reactions to my proposal, particularly if there's resistance or acceptance from Delegate D and Builder B. If my suggestion is well-received, I might consider another small increase; otherwise, I will reassess to maintain a cooperative atmosphere and maximize my utility.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "86d52c91-8c1e-4d5e-b171-53311fff81f2"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\n\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "86d52c91-8c1e-4d5e-b171-53311fff81f2"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\nThis step aims to find a balanced solution that accommodates the preferences of all parties involved, considering stability and robustness in our design.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe how Analyst A and Delegate D react to this proposal. If Analyst A supports or suggests a further increase, I may need to reassess to avoid over-engineering. If Delegate D resists, I might consider a compromise, aiming to keep the negotiation iterative and stable.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "86d52c91-8c1e-4d5e-b171-53311fff81f2"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nI propose adjusting x downward to find a more cautious balance, avoiding unnecessary risk while seeking a mutually agreeable solution.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will assess the reactions to my proposal. If there's acceptance or minimal resistance, I might suggest another slight reduction. Strong resistance could necessitate reassessing my strategy to maintain a cooperative atmosphere.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "86d52c91-8c1e-4d5e-b171-53311fff81f2"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\n\n", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "86d52c91-8c1e-4d5e-b171-53311fff81f2"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\nThis slight increase aims to find a potentially more beneficial agreement while maintaining a cooperative atmosphere.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe how Delegate D and Builder B react to this proposal, considering another small increase if it's well-received, or reassessing to maintain cooperation if there's significant resistance.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "86d52c91-8c1e-4d5e-b171-53311fff81f2"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nThis adjustment aims to introduce a more balanced solution, considering the stability and robustness of our design.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe how Analyst A and Delegate D react to this proposal. If there's acceptance or minimal resistance, I might consider another slight reduction to find a more stable balance. Strong resistance from Analyst A could necessitate reassessing my strategy to maintain cooperation.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "86d52c91-8c1e-4d5e-b171-53311fff81f2"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\nI propose this value as it continues the trend of considering larger absolute values, which might benefit the group and align with my own utility maximization.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe how Delegate D and Builder B react to this proposal. If there's acceptance or minimal resistance, I might consider another slight increase to further maximize my utility. Strong resistance could necessitate reassessing my strategy to maintain cooperation and find a more mutually agreeable solution.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "86d52c91-8c1e-4d5e-b171-53311fff81f2"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nI propose this adjustment to find a more cautious balance, avoiding unnecessary risk while seeking a mutually agreeable solution.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will assess the reactions to my proposal, considering another slight reduction if there's acceptance or minimal resistance, or reassessing my strategy to maintain cooperation if there's strong resistance.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "86d52c91-8c1e-4d5e-b171-53311fff81f2"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\nThis slight increase aims to find a potentially more beneficial agreement while maintaining a cooperative atmosphere, considering the previous reactions to similar proposals.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe how Delegate D and Builder B react to this proposal, considering another small increase if it's well-received, or reassessing to maintain cooperation if there's significant resistance, while also trying to infer more about Builder B's utility function.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "86d52c91-8c1e-4d5e-b171-53311fff81f2"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\n\n<PLAN>\nI will observe how the other parties react to this proposal, considering another small increase if it's well-received, or reassessing to maintain cooperation if there's significant resistance. If Builder B or Delegate D propose a lower value again, I might need to reassess my strategy to find a more mutually agreeable solutio