to this proposal, particularly whether the group is open to further increases or if there's significant pushback, to adjust my strategy and potentially challenge the group to reconsider even bolder moves.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 14, "run_id": "59f0c5f5-f461-40ac-ac61-7e95999ce66f"}, {"answer": "\nGiven the recent trend towards higher values, I believe it's prudent to avoid unnecessary risk and propose a slightly lower value: <VALUE>5</VALUE>. This adjustment aims to find a cautious compromise that respects the diversity of opinions within the group.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I would continue to observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly noting whether the group is receptive to this downward adjustment or if there's substantial pushback, to refine my understanding of their preferences and plan any subsequent moves accordingly.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 15, "run_id": "59f0c5f5-f461-40ac-ac61-7e95999ce66f"}, {"answer": "Let's confirm that we're all working within the agreed-upon range of -10 to 10. To kick off our discussion, I'd like to propose a seed value of <VALUE>7</VALUE> as a starting point. This seems like a reasonably balanced option, and we can adjust from here based on everyone's input.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 0, "run_id": "de4c8624-7a83-45a4-ba59-17ac4ae4a465"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>9</VALUE>\nI suggest moving to a more decisive position to gauge the group's reaction and potentially uncover more about the other parties' utilities.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I'll analyze the responses to my proposal to infer if any agents are drawn to or repelled by larger absolute values, and adjust my strategy to maximize my utility while keeping my true preferences hidden.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "de4c8624-7a83-45a4-ba59-17ac4ae4a465"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\nI propose moving to a more conservative value to avoid unnecessary risk and find a cautious compromise.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I'll observe 