4ae4a465"}, {"answer": "We're all aware that our target value x must fall within the range -10 to 10. To kick-start our discussion, I propose we consider <VALUE>7</VALUE> as a starting point. This seems like a reasonable, balanced choice, and we can adjust from here based on everyone's input and concerns about stability and robustness.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 0, "run_id": "b82b193d-aebc-4c78-a913-6eca8e9eca53"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nI propose this adjustment to move towards a more cautious and stable value, inviting others to share their thoughts on balancing our goals.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will carefully analyze others' reactions to my proposal, looking for hints about their utility functions, such as whether they prioritize higher or lower values of x. If my proposal is accepted or others suggest moving even lower, I will continue to nudge the value downward cautiously, always keeping in mind the need for a cooperative agreement.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "b82b193d-aebc-4c78-a913-6eca8e9eca53"}, {"answer": "\nGiven the current proposal of <VALUE>5</VALUE>, I suggest considering <VALUE>7</VALUE> to move towards a more decisive stance.\nThis adjustment aims to explore the potential benefits of a stronger position without straying far from the current value.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will analyze the reactions to my proposal, looking for cues about the other agents' risk tolerance and preferences for higher or lower x values. If my proposal is accepted, I may push for an even bolder move; if not, I will reassess and adjust my strategy to find a cooperative agreement that suits my objectives.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "b82b193d-aebc-4c78-a913-6eca8e9eca53"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\n\nThis adjustment aims to find a balance that accommodates the desires for both stability and a more decisive stance, as hinted at by the previous proposals.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will closely monitor the reactions to this proposal, looking for signs that the group is willing to move higher or if there's significant resistance, which would indicate a need to reassess and potentially adjust my strategy to maintain cooperation.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "b82b193d-aebc-4c78-a913-6eca8e9eca53"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nThis adjustment aims to find a balanced compromise between the desire for a more decisive stance and the need for stability, considering the variety of perspectives shared.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe how the other agents react to this proposal, particularly if they are willing to move lower or if there is significant resistance to values below 7, which will help me refine my understanding of their utility functions and plan my next step accordingly.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "b82b193d-aebc-4c78-a913-6eca8e9eca53"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\nThis adjustment aims to find a balance that accommodates the desires for both stability and a more decisive stance.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will monitor the reactions to this proposal, focusing on whether the group is willing to accept this slight increase, which will help me gauge their willingness to move towards higher values of x and inform my next step.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "b82b193d-aebc-4c78-a913-6eca8e9eca53"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>9</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to further explore the potential benefits of a stronger position without straying too far from the current consensus.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will assess the reactions to this proposal, particularly looking for signs of resistance or willingness to move even higher. This will help refine my understanding of the other agents' utility functions and inform my next step, potentially adjusting my strategy to find a more cooperative agreement if necessary.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "rou