ate D", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "bed169d2-d676-485c-a3f4-9dc710ed824f"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\n\nGiven the current discussion and the need to find a stable balance, suggesting a value slightly lower than the current seems prudent to ensure all parties' comfort and to avoid unnecessary risk.\n\n<PLAN>\nI will monitor how the other agents react to this proposal. If it's well-received, I might consider another minor adjustment downwards to further refine our compromise. If met with resistance, especially from Analyst A or Critic C, I will emphasize the importance of caution and stability, potentially suggesting a compromise that still prioritizes balance.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "bed169d2-d676-485c-a3f4-9dc710ed824f"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>8</VALUE>\nI aim to make a decisive move towards a stronger position without excessive risk.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will monitor the reactions to my proposal and adjust my strategy accordingly. If met with resistance, I may consider a minor adjustment downwards, potentially to 6, while emphasizing the importance of making a bold yet reasonable move.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "bed169d2-d676-485c-a3f4-9dc710ed824f"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "bed169d2-d676-485c-a3f4-9dc710ed824f"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "bed169d2-d676-485c-a3f4-9dc710ed824f"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\nWe can consider a slight increase from the current value, aiming for a moderate compromise that balances the needs of all parties.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will monitor the reactions to my proposal and adjust my strategy accordingly. If met with resistance, I may consider a minor adjustment downwards to maintain a stable balance.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "bed169d2-d676-485c-a3f4-9dc710ed824f"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>9</VAL